  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/TheAutanPlusBand7aniversariCafeteriaDruida1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Cafeter&iacute;a Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda, regentada por Manu Llorens Porcar, ha celebrado este mi&eacute;rcoles 8 de octubre su 7&ordm; aniversario con un concierto del grupo ondense de punk-rock The Autan Plus Band.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/theautanplusband7aniversaridruida/theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida1.jpg\" alt=\"theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/theautanplusband7aniversaridruida/theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida2.jpg\" alt=\"theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/theautanplusband7aniversaridruida/theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida3.jpg\" alt=\"theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/theautanplusband7aniversaridruida/theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida4.jpg\" alt=\"theautanplusband7aniversaricafeteriadruida4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
